# backend/.dockerignore
#
# All build contexts are the repo root (every Dockerfile COPYs shared/ plus a
# service tree), so patterns need `**/` prefixes to match nested paths -
# unanchored patterns like `tests/` only match at the context root.
.git
.github
.claude/

# Env files and secrets - never ship into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/

# Tests and tooling caches.
**/tests/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/*.egg-info/

# Docs.
docs/
**/*.md
!README.md
